x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Combien d&apos;hivers dans un seul regard</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cuántos inviernos en una mirada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wie viele Winter in einem einzigen Blick</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quantos invernos em um olhar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сколько зим затаилось в одном лишь взгляде</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quanti inverni in uno sguardo</span></p><p begin="27.650" end="29.910" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.650" end="27.750">Lo</span><span begin="27.750" end="27.860">st</span> <span begin="27.860" end="27.980">in</span><span begin="27.980" end="28.340">si</span><span begin="28.340" end="28.390">de</span> <span begin="28.390" end="28.560">a</span> <span begin="28.700" end="29.720">ma</span><span begin="29.720" end="29.910">ze?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又在这无解的迷局中 迷失了多久</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">又在這無解的迷局中 迷失了多久</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">迷宮の中に迷い込みながら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">길을 잃고 헤매던 미궁 속에서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Perdue au cœur d&apos;un labyrinthe ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿Perdida dentro de un laberinto?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Verloren in einem Labyrinth?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Perdida dentro de um labirinto?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Потерянном внутри лабиринта</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Persa in un labirinto</span></p><p begin="30.810" end="35.040" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.810" end="30.950">And</span> <span begin="30.950" end="31.330">how</span> <span begin="31.330" end="31.820">ma</span><span begin="31.820" end="31.890">ny</span> <span begin="31.970" end="32.360">fee</span><span begin="32.360" end="32.970">ling</span><span begin="32.970" end="33.100">s</span> <span begin="33.640" end="33.840">un</span><span begin="33.840" end="33.900">s</span><span begin="33.990" end="34.260">po</span><span begin="34.340" end="35.040">ken</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又有多少从未诉诸于口的万千思绪</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">又有多少從未訴諸於口的萬千思緒</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">そして 言葉にされなかった幾つの感情を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그리고 입 밖으로 내지 못한 감정들은 얼마나 많이</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et combien de sentiments inavoués</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y cuántos sentimientos no dichos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und wie viele unausgesprochene Gefühle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E quantos sentimentos não ditos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И сколько чувств так и остались невысказанными</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E quanti sentimenti inespressi</span></p><p begin="35.620" end="37.880" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.620" end="35.970">Hel</span><span begin="35.970" end="36.020">d</span> <span begin="36.020" end="36.330">in</span> <span begin="36.330" end="36.520">thi</span><span begin="36.520" end="36.670">s</span> <span begin="36.670" end="37.830">han</span><span begin="37.830" end="37.880">d?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾被紧紧攥在这掌心里</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">曾被緊緊攥在這掌心裡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">この手に抱え込んできたのだろう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이 손안에 쥐어져 있었던가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Sont retenus dans cette main ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿Sostenidos en esta mano?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Gehalten in dieser Hand?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Guardados nesta mão?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Что я сжимала в этой руке</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Stretti in questa mano</span></p><p begin="38.820" end="43.190" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.820" end="38.920">The</span> <span begin="39.000" end="39.340">weigh</span><span begin="39.340" end="39.410">t</span> <span begin="39.410" end="39.760">o</span><span begin="39.760" end="39.840">f</span> <span begin="39.840" end="40.030">the</span> <span begin="40.030" end="40.240">old</span> <span begin="40.240" end="40.380">s</span><span begin="40.380" end="41.100">kie</span><span begin="41.100" end="41.240">s</span> <span begin="41.690" end="41.850">on</span> <span begin="41.850" end="41.920">my</span> <span begin="42.010" end="42.380">shoul</span><span begin="42.380" end="43.060">der</span><span begin="43.060" end="43.190">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">双肩之上 承载着旧日天空的沉重</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">雙肩之上 承載著舊日天空的沉重</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">両の肩にのしかかる 古き空の重み</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어깨 위에 지워진 지나간 하늘의 무게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le poids des cieux anciens sur mes épaules</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El peso de los viejos cielos sobre mis hombros</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Last der alten Himmel auf meinen Schultern</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O peso dos velhos céus sobre os meus ombros</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Тяжесть былых небес на моих плечах</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il peso di cieli antichi sulle mie spalle</span></p><p begin="43.620" end="45.410" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.620" end="44.010">Sun</span><span begin="44.010" end="44.320">ligh</span><span begin="44.320" end="44.360">t</span> <span begin="44.360" end="44.670">in</span> <span begin="44.670" end="44.810">di</span><span begin="44.810" end="44.970">s</span><span begin="44.970" end="45.350">gui</span><span begin="45.350" end="45.410">se</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那不过是隐匿了身形的日光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那不過是隱匿了身形的日光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">姿を変えた太陽の光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">어둠 속에 모습을 감춘 햇살</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La lumière du soleil dissimulée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Luz del sol disfrazada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Verborgenes Sonnenlicht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A luz do sol disfarçada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Скрытый солнечный свет</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Luce del sole celata</span></p><p begin="45.660" end="46.960" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.660" end="46.010">Who</span> <span begin="46.010" end="46.470">woul</span><span begin="46.470" end="46.510">d</span> <span begin="46.510" end="46.600">ha</span><span begin="46.600" end="46.680">ve</span> <span begin="46.680" end="46.960">known</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又有谁能料到</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">又有誰能料到</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">誰が知り得ただろうか</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그 누가 알았으랴</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Qui aurait pu imaginer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Quién hubiera sabido</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wer hätte geahnt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quem saberia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Кто мог знать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Chi l&apos;avrebbe mai detto</span></p><p begin="47.320" end="52.730" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.320" end="47.640">There</span><span begin="47.640" end="47.710">&apos;s</span> <span begin="47.710" end="48.020">a</span><span begin="48.020" end="48.050">n</span> <span begin="48.050" end="48.570">en</span><span begin="48.570" end="48.650">d</span> <span begin="48.990" end="49.680">to</span> <span begin="49.680" end="49.880">e</span><span begin="49.960" end="50.490">ter</span><span begin="50.490" end="50.680">ni</span><span begin="50.680" end="52.730">ty?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">原来这漫长的永恒 亦有其终点</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">原來這漫長的永恆 亦有其終點</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">永恒にも終わりがあるということを</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">영원에도 끝이 있다는 것을</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Qu&apos;il existerait une fin à l&apos;éternité ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿Que hay un final para la eternidad?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Dass die Ewigkeit ein Ende hat?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Que existe um fim para a eternidade?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Что у вечности есть конец</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Che c&apos;è una fine all&apos;eternità</span></p><p begin="53.650" end="56.500" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.650" end="54.000">The</span> <span begin="54.000" end="54.520">lo</span><span begin="54.520" end="54.560">ne</span> <span begin="54.950" end="55.340">tale</span> <span begin="55.340" end="55.600">i</span><span begin="55.600" end="55.790">s</span> <span begin="55.790" end="55.910">no</span> <span begin="55.990" end="56.500">more</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">孤独流传的荒原古道 自此不复存在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">孤獨流傳的荒原古道 自此不復存在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">孤独な物語は もう終わりを告げる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">고독했던 옛이야기는 이제 없으리</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le conte solitaire n&apos;est plus</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El relato solitario ya no existe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die einsame Geschichte ist vorüber</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O conto solitário não existe mais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Одинокой повести больше нет</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La storia solitaria non esiste più</span></p><p begin="56.980" end="1:00.470" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.980" end="57.240">A</span><span begin="57.240" end="57.330">s</span> <span begin="57.330" end="57.640">a</span> <span begin="57.640" end="57.890">bree</span><span begin="57.890" end="57.990">ze</span> <span begin="57.990" end="58.360">bru</span><span begin="58.450" end="58.840">she</span><span begin="58.840" end="58.990">s</span> <span begin="58.990" end="1:00.470">by</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当微风轻轻拂过</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">當微風輕輕拂過</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">そよ風が頬をかすめ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">한 줄기 미풍이 스쳐 지나가고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tandis qu&apos;une brise m&apos;effleure</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Mientras una brisa roza</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Während eine Brise sanft vorbeistreicht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Enquanto uma brisa passa de leve</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Когда легкий ветерок проносится мимо</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mentre una brezza mi accarezza</span></p><p begin="1:00.980" end="1:04.430" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.980" end="1:01.180">A</span><span begin="1:01.180" end="1:01.330">s</span> <span begin="1:01.330" end="1:01.680">the</span> <span begin="1:01.680" end="1:01.940">day</span><span begin="1:01.940" end="1:02.000">s</span> <span begin="1:02.000" end="1:02.360">dri</span><