</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Encontré una orilla firme de confianza</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Fand ich ein sicheres Ufer des Vertrauens</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Encontrei uma margem firme de confiança</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я нашла надежный берег доверия</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ho trovato una sponda sicura di fiducia</span></p><p begin="1:09.040" end="1:11.480" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.040" end="1:09.340">In</span> <span begin="1:09.340" end="1:09.520">thi</span><span begin="1:09.520" end="1:09.670">s</span> <span begin="1:09.670" end="1:10.190">va</span><span begin="1:10.190" end="1:10.380">st</span> <span begin="1:10.380" end="1:11.480">world</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">寻得了一处 可以安稳栖息的信任彼岸</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">尋得了一處 可以安穩棲息的信任彼岸</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">この広大な世界の中で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이 광활한 세계 속에서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dans ce vaste monde</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">En este vasto mundo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">In dieser weiten Welt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Neste vasto mundo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В этом бескрайнем мире</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">In questo vasto mondo</span></p><p begin="1:12.950" end="1:16.480" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.950" end="1:13.200">A</span><span begin="1:13.200" end="1:13.330">s</span> <span begin="1:13.330" end="1:13.680">we</span> <span begin="1:13.680" end="1:13.890">walk</span> <span begin="1:13.990" end="1:14.490">side</span> <span begin="1:14.490" end="1:14.820">by</span> <span begin="1:14.960" end="1:16.430">si</span><span begin="1:16.430" end="1:16.480">de</span><span ttm:role="x-translatio