slation" xml:lang="de">Fand ich ein sicheres Ufer des Vertrauens</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Encontrei uma margem firme de confiança</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я нашла надежный берег доверия</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ho trovato una sponda sicura di fiducia</span></p><p begin="2:40.020" end="2:42.410" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:40.020" end="2:40.330">In</span> <span begin="2:40.330" end="2:40.520">thi</span><span begin="2:40.520" end="2:40.670">s</span> <span begin="2:40.670" end="2:41.180">va</span><span begin="2:41.180" end="2:41.370">st</span> <span begin="2:41.370" end="2:42.410">world</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">寻得了一处 可以安稳栖息的信任彼岸</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">尋得了一處 可以安穩棲息的信任彼岸</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">この広大な世界の中で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이 광활한 세계 속에서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dans ce vaste monde</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">En este vasto mundo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">In dieser weiten Welt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Neste vasto mundo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В этом бескрайнем мире</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">In questo vasto mondo</span></p><p begin="2:43.940" end="2:47.390" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:43.940" end="2:44.190">A</span><span begin="2:44.190" end="2:44.320">s</span> <span begin="2:44.320" end="2:44.650">we</span> <span begin="2:44.650" end="2:44.890">walk</span> <span begin="2:44.980" end="2:45.500">side</span> <span begin="2:45.500" end="2:45.820">by</span> <span begin="2:45.950" end="2:47.390">side</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我们并肩而行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">當我們並肩而行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私たちが肩を並べて歩むとき</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리가 나란히 발맞추어 걸어갈 때</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Alors que nous marchons côte à côte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Mientras caminamos lado a lado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Während wir Seite an Seite gehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Enquanto caminhamos lado a lado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Когда мы идем плечом к плечу</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mentre camminiamo fianco a fianco</span></p><p begin="2:47.980" end="2:51.380" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:47.980" end="2:48.170">The</span> <span begin="2:48.170" end="2:48.300">s</span><span begin="2:48.300" end="2:48.580">cri</span><span begin="2:48.580" end="2:48.680">pt</span> <span begin="2:48.680" end="2:48.870">i</span><span begin="2:48.870" end="2:49.000">s</span> <span begin="2:49.000" end="2:49.500">fa</span><span begin="2:49.500" end="2:50.000">ding</span> <span begin="2:50.000" end="2:50.450">a</span><span begin="2:50.660" end="2:51.380">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经写就的既定剧本 正在缓缓褪色消散</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">曾經寫就的既定劇本 正在緩緩褪色消散</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">定められた台本は薄れて消えゆき</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오래된 각본은 희미하게 바래어가고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le scénario s&apos;efface peu à peu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El guion se desvanece</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Verblasst das geschriebene Schicksal</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O roteiro está desaparecendo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Старый сценарий постепенно угасает</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il copione sta svanendo</span></p><p begin="2:52.040" end="2:55.600" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:52.040" end="2:52.340">And</span> <span begin="2:52.340" end="2:52.540">the</span> <span begin="2:52.630" end="2:52.980">fro</span><span begin="2:52.980" end="2:53.360">zen</span> <span begin="2:53.480" end="2:54.170">dawn</span> <span begin="2:54.500" end="2:54.630">s</span><span begin="2:54.630" end="2:54.880">tream</span><span begin="2:54.880" end="2:54.970">s</span> <span begin="2:54.970" end="2:55.530">for</span><span begin="2:55.530" end="2:55.600">th</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那原本被冰封的黎明 随之喷涌而出</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那原本被冰封的黎明 隨之噴湧而出</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">凍てついていた夜明けの光が溢れ出す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">얼어붙었던 여명이 뿜어져 나오네</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et l&apos;aube gelée se déverse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y el amanecer helado fluye hacia adelante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und die gefrorene Morgendämmerung strömt hervor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E o amanhecer congelado flui adiante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И замерзший рассвет прорывается вперед</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E l&apos;alba di ghiaccio sgorga</span></p><p begin="2:55.990" end="2:59.420" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:55.990" end="2:56.210">The</span> <span begin="2:56.310" end="2:56.650">weigh</span><span begin="2:56.650" end="2:56.690">t</span> <span begin="2:56.690" end="2:56.990">of</span> <span begin="2:56.990" end="2:57.350">ye</span><span begin="2:57.350" end="2:57.510">s</span><span begin="2:57.510" end="2:57.980">ter</span><span begin="2:57.980" end="2:59.420">day</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">昨日所留下的沉重枷锁</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">昨日所留下的沉重枷鎖</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">昨日までの重みが</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">지나간 어제의 묵직한 무게는</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le fardeau d&apos;hier</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El peso del ayer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Last von gestern</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O peso de ontem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Груз вчерашнего дня</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il peso di ieri</span></p><p begin="2:59.950" end="3:03.560" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:59.950" end="3:00.190">Will</span> <span begin="3:00.310" end="3:00.640">ne</span><span begin="3:00.640" end="3:00.960">ver</span> <span begin="3:00.960" end="3:01.390">hold</span> <span begin="3:01.480" end="3:02.000">me</span> <span begin="3:02.000" end="3:02.640">a</span><span begin="3:02.640" end="3:03.500">gai</span><span begin="3:03.500" end="3:03.560">n</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再也无法将我的前路困阻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">再也無法將我的前路困阻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">二度と私を縛り付けることはない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">더는 나를 붙잡아매지 못하리니</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ne me retiendra plus jamais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nunca más me retendrá</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wird mich nie wieder zurückhalten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Nunca mais vai me prender</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Больше никогда не удержит меня</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non mi tratterrà mai più</span></p><p begin="3:03.980" end="3:07.830" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:03.980" end="3:04.190">Cau</span><span begin="3:04.190" end="3:04.330">se</span> <span begin="3:04.330" end="3:04.660">when</span> <span begin="3:04.660" end="3:04.880">the</span> <span begin="3:04.970" end="3:05.320">tide</span><span begin="3:05.320" end="3:05.490">s</span> <span begin="3:05.490" end="3:06.180">turn</span> <span begin="3:06.620" end="3:06.940">and</span> <span begin="3:06.940" end="3:07.170">s</span><span begin="3:07.170" end="3:07.830">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为当命运的潮汐开始翻涌摇曳之时</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">因為當命運的潮汐開始翻湧搖曳之時</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">潮の満ち引きが変わり 揺れ動こうとも</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">시대의 조류가 뒤바뀌고 흔들릴지라도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Car lorsque les marées tourneront et basculeront</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque cuando las mareas giren y oscilen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Denn wenn die Gezeiten sich wenden und wogen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Porque quando as marés virarem e balançarem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ведь когда приливы меняются и колеблются</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché quando le maree cambiano e oscillano</span></p><p begin="3:08.020" end="3:10.610" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:08.020" end="3:08.360">We&apos;ll</span> <span begin="3:08.360" end="3:08.700">know</span> <span begin="3:08.700" end="3:09.190">our</span> <span begin="3:09.360" end="3:10.610">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们早已明晰了 属于我们的道路</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們早已明晰了 屬於我們的道路</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私たちは進むべき道を知っているから</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리는 우리가 나아갈 길을 알 터이기에</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous connaîtrons notre chemin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Conoceremos nuestro camino</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Werden wir unseren Weg kennen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Nós saberemos o nosso caminho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мы будем знать свой путь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Noi sapremo quale strada prendere</span></p><p begin="3:11.960" end="3:15.430" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:11.960" end="3:12.150">Don&apos;t</span> <span begin="3:12.320" end="3:12.660">need</span> <span begin="3:12.660" end="3:12.920">to</span> <span begin="3:13.000" end="3:13.540">be</span> <span begin="3:13.540" end="3:13.890">a</span><span begin="3:13.890" end="3:14.020">f</span><span begin="3:14.020" end="3:15.430">raid</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自此无需再去惶恐害怕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">自此無需再去惶恐害怕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">恐れる必要などない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">두려워할 필요는 없네</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nul besoin d&apos;avoir peur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No hay necesidad de tener miedo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Brauchen uns nicht zu fürchten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não precisa ter medo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Нам незачем больше бояться</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non c&apos;è bisogno di avere paura</span></p><p begin="3:15.940" end="3:19.420" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:15.940" end="3:16.130">Set</span> <span begin="3:16.280" end="3:16.680">sail</span> <span begin="3:16.680" end="3:16.980">and</span> <span begin="3:16.980" end="3:17.520">row</span> <span begin="3:17.520" end="3:18.010">a</span><span begin="3:18.010" end="3:19.420">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">扬帆起航 向着远方破浪前行吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">揚帆起航 向著遠方破浪前行吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">帆を揚げて 漕ぎ出そう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">돛을 올리고 저 편으로 노를 저어가자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Hissons les voiles et ramons au loin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Zarpemos y rememos 